  "title": "Authentic Thai Steak Salad",
  "description": "Grilled flank steak is served on a bed of romaine lettuce with fresh mint, cilantro, and Thai basil and tossed in a flavorful lime juice dressing in this authentic Thai steak salad.",
  "authors": [
